# Local environment overrides. `.env` in this repo holds only PUBLIC values
# (project URL + publishable key, both shipped to the browser anyway).
# Secrets — SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY, VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY — belong in Vercel's
# environment variables, or in .env.local for local development. Never in .env,
# which is committed.
.env.local
.env.*.local
